<title>USA: TCI names Marvin Jones COO of cable unit.</title>
<headline>TCI names Marvin Jones COO of cable unit.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Co. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele-Communications Inc said Tuesday that it has named Marvin Jones chief operating officer of its cable division, TCI Communications Inc.</p>
<p>Prior to joining TCI, Jones was president and chief executive at United Artists Cablesystems Corp, which merged into TCI in 1991.</p>
